{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_spst_16-02","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"spst_16-02","title":"往事","storyCode":"EG-8","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_16-02.txt","sourceHash":"26c2da8eb43d5b9df471c8c2ee2e2a933a60dd6013c62d190d48c4b3dbf26d4a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一座沉沒的城市重見天日，一盞廢棄的礦燈再度亮起。這年頭太怪了，什麼事都有可能發生。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g5_deepmine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轟炸……轟炸停止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們、我們走吧，好嗎？不是去地上，而是繼續從下面走，趁那些炸彈還沒炸到我們這裡——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……起來，尤里，還有其他人。我們得去找雷爾金，還有他說的那個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的兄弟姐妹中，勇敢的那些都跟雷爾金去佔領崗哨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在轟炸停下來了，上面不知道是什麼情況。如果還想見到他們，就只能上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去幫他們，或者像雷爾金說的那樣，去記住他們。走不動的就用手、用礦鎬，爬也要爬上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是雷爾金把他的礦燈託付給我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你記得他說了什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽小的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他……他什麼也沒說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就對了，他什麼也沒說。這和他們留下的那些物資沒什麼區別，只是一份保障。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也可以選擇把它留在這裡，就像……一個提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，提醒。把礦燈放進礦車裡吧，就放在我們過來的時候一路推著的那輛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……如果有人會來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤里，我記得你會寫字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這本工作日誌後面是空白的，不用白不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來。我說，你寫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，如果有人來，他們至少會知道這裡發生過什麼事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯北原，某礦場</><p=2>1101年冬</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病重的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"長……長官大人，請問我們現在……要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病重的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"這好像不是回廠裡的方向——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，繼續往前走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懷疑的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）礦場又停工了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懷疑的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）挖不出東西……加工廠裡就沒有原材料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懷疑的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）如果上面用不到這麼多人手了，我們會被帶去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連病得最重的那幾個都被趕出來了，半個礦場的人都在這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想走了，我不想死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懷疑的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）小聲一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集團軍士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集團軍士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穿過樹林，去湖邊。那裡，是你們的墓地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集團軍士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在抵達之前，不要妄想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集團軍士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自己能夠逃走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"深林中，不斷有厚重的軍靴踩在雪地上，前進著，也催促著。\n礦工們的“護送者”不僅僅只有隊伍前面這幾位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集團軍士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就到這裡，停下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集團軍士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都站到冰面上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，長官大人，我不想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"軍刀將她的話語和脖頸一起割斷，血液夾雜著熱氣噴濺在軍人的盔甲上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集團軍士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了烏薩斯的榮光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病重的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"天……天啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集團軍士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"後、後面的人，趕快補上她的空位，快點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懷疑的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們為什麼要遭受這樣的對待？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"別*烏薩斯粗口*廢話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懷疑的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道陛下的承諾都是假的嗎？我們的命還不如一隻馱獸有分量嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懷疑的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集團軍士官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1978_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"在軍人再度抬手的瞬間，地面的震顫也終於能夠為人所感知。\n起先只是細微的斷裂，來自湖面，來自地下，而後是如骨牌倒塌般的連鎖反應。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"大地顫動，湖心塌陷，逐日累積的地形變化終於引起質變。它吞噬冰面上的感染者，也吞噬即將對他們行刑的劊子手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懷疑的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑——快跑！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"趁衛兵也愣住的瞬間，礦工甩開對方的鉗制，往來時的方向跑去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚恐的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天災——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚恐的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是天災！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"士兵，礦工；加害者，受害者。廣闊的安加拉湖包容了所有，又送出了所有。\n塌陷的冰面之下，一座古老的移動城市隨地形的變化驟然上升，衝破冰封，終於得以重見天日。\n而在那上面……舊式建築群、死者相貌猙獰的屍骨，都仍保留著它們沉入水底時的模樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯遠北，災後重建區域</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勤奮的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“北原”……“天災”……“湖”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勤奮的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這麼一小塊地方，這麼多詞，我只知道三個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"慢慢來，你總有一天都會知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的課程對我來說太基礎了。現在礦井沒人管理，我打算把那份工作接下來，再想辦法去學一門修鞋以外的手藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等戒嚴解除，我要去聖駿堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勤奮的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不想去聖駿堡，我只想讀書。每天學會三個詞，一週就是二十一個，一個月就是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡謝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_415_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很高興看到你們始終懷有一顆向上的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡謝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_415_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我的幫助嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勤奮的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些詞，女士，它們還是讓我糊塗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡謝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_415_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信你說的是這些“名詞”，對嗎？因為這是我們這週的課程——“認識名詞”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勤奮的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“名詞”——對，名詞！我好像已經能分辨出來了，但還沒辦法確定它們的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勤奮的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"比如這個……“腮門刻”……是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡謝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_415_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡謝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_415_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它讀作“塞夢珂”。就像上一行裡的湖叫“安加拉”，也像你叫“沃瓦”一樣，它只是一個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡謝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_415_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一座移動城市的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g5_deepmine"},{"type":"narration","text":"告別了同伴，青年下到礦井中，準備開始工作。\n礦道無人維護就會損壞，礦井無人看管就可能會發生坍方。至少在他離開這裡之前，他不會允許以上兩件事情發生。\n青年舉著礦燈開始巡邏。他仔細地查看所有軌道，直到發現一輛明顯不屬於這裡的礦車，出現在其中一條岔路上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……這是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"礦燈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有一封信——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一場抗爭……曾在這裡醞釀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天啊。提出礦區互連的人來過這裡！他們想佔領那個有駐軍的崗哨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道，那不是憑空捏造……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i20"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論這是誰的燈，它都被保存得很好，還能點亮，只是上面有些灰塵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許我應該把它帶走，帶去聖駿堡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……然後讓所有人看看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這盞沒有名字的礦燈，和那些沒有名字的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
